        ("If an electric train is traveling north at 60 mph and the wind is blowing west at 20 mph, which way does the smoke blow?", "There is no smoke because it is an electric train", ["North", "West", "Southwest"], "Electric trains run on electricity and emit zero smoke."),
        ("What can fill an entire room without taking up any physical space?", "Light", ["Air", "Sound", "Furniture"], "Photons of light illuminate a volume without displacing solid matter."),
        ("What has legs but cannot walk?", "A table", ["A dog", "A chair", "A stool"], "Furniture like tables and chairs have support legs but cannot ambulate."),
        ("What can you break without ever touching or picking it up?", "A promise", ["A window", "A bone", "A plate"], "You can break an intangible oath, trust, or promise through your actions."),
