        ("What part of speech is 'daily' in 'He reads a daily newspaper'?", "Adjective", ["Adverb", "Noun", "Verb"], "'Daily' modifies the noun 'newspaper', functioning as an adjective."),
        ("What part of speech is 'daily' in 'She exercises daily'?", "Adverb", ["Adjective", "Noun", "Preposition"], "'Daily' modifies the verb 'exercises', telling when the action occurs."),
        ("Which of the following is a compound noun?", "Toothbrush", ["Beautiful", "Quickly", "Inasmuch"], "A compound noun merges two words ('tooth' + 'brush') into a single noun."),
        ("What part of speech is 'since' in 'I have not seen her since Tuesday'?", "Preposition", ["Conjunction", "Adverb", "Interjection"], "'Since' is followed by the noun object 'Tuesday', acting as a preposition of time."),
        ("What part of speech is 'since' in 'Since you are here, let us begin'?", "Subordinating conjunction", ["Preposition", "Adverb", "Noun"], "'Since' introduces a causal clause with a subject and verb."),
